OL,3,GNEWSA'It's you against a bus full of
OL,4,Apeople' veteran driver doubts new fines
OL,5,Aplan
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter 41 years driving buses, Pete
OL,8,FGibson says he has seen just about
OL,9,Feverything. Fights, drug use, abuse and
OL,10,Feven having a knife pulled on him are
OL,11,Famong the incidents he recalls from
OL,12,Fmore than four decades behind the
OL,13,Fwheel.
OL,15,FSo when the government announced plans
OL,16,Fto fine passengers up to #100 for
OL,17,Fantisocial behaviour on buses in
OL,18,FEngland, the veteran driver was
OL,19,Fsceptical.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
