OL,3,GNEWSA'It's you against a bus full of
OL,4,Apeople' veteran driver doubts new fines
OL,5,Aplan
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe measures are aimed at tackling loud
OL,8,Fmusic, littering, vaping and
OL,9,Fthreatening behaviour on public
OL,10,Ftransport, but Gibson doubts they will
OL,11,Fmake much difference without meaningful
OL,12,Fenforcement.
OL,14,F"It's something that cannot be
OL,15,Fpoliced," he said.
